1
00:00:02,877 --> 00:00:04,504
Ji-sung

2
00:00:05,497 --> 00:00:07,749
you really didn't have to
walk me back.

3
00:00:09,384 --> 00:00:12,012
But... the stuff
Jeong-min said

4
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:14,472
none of it was true, right?

5
00:00:14,472 --> 00:00:16,182
What exactly do you mean?

6
00:00:16,182 --> 00:00:18,268
That at first

7
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:19,060
you only took me in

8
00:00:19,060 --> 00:00:21,062
because you pitied me.

9
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:23,565
Not entirely false, at first.

10
00:00:24,315 --> 00:00:27,318
When the coach called

11
00:00:28,069 --> 00:00:30,697
I did feel hesitant.

12
00:00:31,698 --> 00:00:34,701
He made it sound
like you were trouble.

13
00:00:34,702 --> 00:00:37,622
But then I saw you
walk into the treatment room

14
00:00:37,623 --> 00:00:40,668
and everything changed.

15
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:44,377
You looked terrified

16
00:00:44,377 --> 00:00:47,380
but also like you were ready
to fight through it.

17
00:00:48,923 --> 00:00:51,593
After that first session

18
00:00:51,593 --> 00:00:55,013
when you quietly
said “thank you”

19
00:00:56,946 --> 00:00:59,949
that's when
something changed in me.

20
00:01:01,051 --> 00:01:04,054
I wanted to help you.
Genuinely.

21
00:01:04,498 --> 00:01:07,251
When did you start

22
00:01:07,252 --> 00:01:09,546
liking me?

23
00:01:09,547 --> 00:01:12,550
The moment you smiled so
brightly for the first time.

24
00:01:12,647 --> 00:01:14,774
When was that?

25
00:01:14,775 --> 00:01:16,986
Don't you remember?

26
00:01:16,987 --> 00:01:18,864
When I tickled you.

27
00:01:18,865 --> 00:01:22,285
You laughed so hard
and shoved my hands away.

28
00:01:23,658 --> 00:01:26,661
That's when I thought

29
00:01:26,905 --> 00:01:31,840
“Wow, his smile
is really beautiful.

30
00:01:33,384 --> 00:01:36,387
I want to see more of it.”

31
00:01:36,387 --> 00:01:39,682
I won't doubt you anymore.

32
00:01:39,682 --> 00:01:41,142
Promise?

33
00:01:41,142 --> 00:01:42,685
Yeah.

34
00:01:42,685 --> 00:01:45,730
I promise.

35
00:01:45,730 --> 00:01:48,358
Then I'll promise too.

36
00:01:48,358 --> 00:01:52,112
I won't let anyone
come between us again.
